          "docs": "This view extends the base quote list view to add filtering capabilities\nwhile maintaining the pending quote refresh functionality.\n\nQuery Parameters:\n    coverage_type (str): Filter by coverage type code (e.g., 'CYB', 'GL')\n    aggregate_limit (int): Filter by aggregate limit value\n    sub_coverage (str, optional): Filter by sub-coverage type for ML products"
